><p>This living, searchable resource tracks legal challenges to Trump admin=
istration executive actions. If you think we are missing anything, you can =
email us at <a href=3D"mailto:lte@justsecurity.org" aria-label=3D"lte@justs=
ecurity.org- opens in new tab">lte@justsecurity.org</a>. The Tracker is par=
t of the <a href=3D"https://www.justsecurity.org/106653/collection-trump-ad=
ministration-executive-actions/">Collection: Just Security=E2=80=99s Covera=
ge of the Trump Administration=E2=80=99s Executive Actions</a>.</p>
<p><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">For</span><span style=3D"font-weight: =
400;"> important litigation updates delivered to your inbox at the end of e=
very weekday, sign up for </span><a href=3D"https://www.justsecurity.org/ne=
wsletter-signup/"><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">=E2=80=9CToday on Just =
Security,=E2=80=9D</span></a><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;"> a weekday n=
ewsletter that also includes our articles from the day. Readers may also be=
 interested in </span><a href=3D"https://www.justsecurity.org/early-edition=
-signup/"><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">signing up</span></a><span styl=
e=3D"font-weight: 400;"> for our free Early Edition roundup of global and n=
ational news each workday morning. (Both sign-ups are free and we respect y=
our privacy; your email address is only used to send you the requested emai=
l). If you would like to help support our efforts, we appreciate </span><a =
href=3D"https://www.justsecurity.org/donate/"><span style=3D"font-weight: 4=
00;">donations</span></a><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;"> of any amount, =
as it takes a village to produce this work.</span></p>
