" data-target=3D"collapsible-6a1076b60d3e4"><span class=3D"js-plus-icon">+<=
/span><span class=3D"js-plus-title"><strong>Methodology: What=E2=80=99s inc=
luded in our tracker? What's excluded?</strong></span></div><div class=3D"j=
s-plus-collapsible-content" id=3D"collapsible-6a1076b60d3e4" style=3D"displ=
ay: none;">
<ul>
<li style=3D"font-weight: 400;" aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight=
: 400;">We do not track cases in which the Trump administration is the plai=
ntiff/files a civil lawsuit. Some other organizations include those cases i=
n their litigation trackers =E2=80=93 ours tracks only challenges to Trump =
administration executive actions.</span></li>
<li style=3D"font-weight: 400;" aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight=
: 400;">We do not count appeals as separate cases. (The appeal of a distric=
t court decision to a Court of Appeals and/or Supreme Court is part of the =
same case.)</span></li>
<li style=3D"font-weight: 400;" aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight=
: 400;">We treat as </span><a href=3D"https://www.justsecurity.org/107087/t=
racker-litigation-legal-challenges-trump-administration/?js_filter=3D01998"=
><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">one case</span></a><span style=3D"font-w=
eight: 400;"> all the lawsuits involving the removal of F-1 foreign student=
 visa registration. According to </span><a href=3D"https://www.politico.com=
/news/2025/04/25/foreign-students-visas-donald-trump-00311600" aria-label=
=3D"Politico- opens in new tab"><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">Politico<=
/span></a><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">, there were =E2=80=9Cmore than=
 100 lawsuits and 50 restraining orders from dozens of federal judges,=E2=
=80=9D before the government </span><a href=3D"https://www.politico.com/new=
s/2025/04/25/trump-admin-reverses-termination-foreign-student-visa-registra=
tions-00309407" aria-label=3D"reversed- opens in new tab"><span style=3D"fo=
nt-weight: 400;">reversed</span></a><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;"> its =
decision and restored the F-1 registrations on or about Apr. 25, 2025.</spa=
n></li>
<li style=3D"font-weight: 400;" aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight=
: 400;">On tariffs policy, we track </span><a href=3D"https://www.justsecur=
ity.org/107087/tracker-litigation-legal-challenges-trump-administration/?js=
_filter=3Dtariff"><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">eight principal cases</=
span></a><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">. We do not track the dozens of =
individual cases that have been filed in the Court of International Trade c=
hallenging the administration=E2=80=99s tariff policies.&nbsp; </span><b><i=
>&nbsp;</i></b></li>
<li style=3D"font-weight: 400;" aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight=
: 400;">We treat as </span><a href=3D"https://www.justsecurity.org/107087/t=
racker-litigation-legal-challenges-trump-administration/?js_filter=3D01873"=
><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">one case</span></a><span style=3D"font-w=
eight: 400;"> all the lawsuits involving the administration=E2=80=99s new m=
andatory immigration detention policy. </span><a href=3D"https://www.politi=
co.com/news/2025/11/28/trump-detention-deportation-policy-00669861" aria-la=
bel=3D"Politico- opens in new tab"><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">Politi=
co</span></a><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;"> reported, as of Nov. 28, 20=
25, =E2=80=9Cat least 225 judges have ruled in more than 700 cases that the=
 administration=E2=80=99s new policy, which also deprives people of an oppo=
rtunity to seek release from an immigration court, is a likely violation of=
 law and the right to due process.=E2=80=9D</span></li>
</ul>
