featured-story&amp;channel=3Dbusiness-and-practice" aria-label=3D"ruling fr=
om the bench- opens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferre=
r">ruling from the bench</a>, granted Perkins Coie=E2=80=99s request for a =
temporary restraining order to block Sections 1, 3, and 5 of the executive =
order. During the hearing, she <a href=3D"https://bsky.app/profile/chrisgei=
dner.bsky.social/post/3lk7dshpdfc2d" aria-label=3D"reportedly- opens in new=
