e firm, including: suspending employees=E2=80=99 security clearances pendin=
g a national-interest review; terminating the firm=E2=80=99s government con=
tracts to the extent permitted by law; and limiting employees=E2=80=99 acce=
ss to federal buildings. Plaintiff <a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener=
.com/recap/gov.uscourts.dcd.278933/gov.uscourts.dcd.278933.1.0_4.pdf" aria-=
label=3D"sued- opens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferr=
