=80=99s authority and interferes with federal courts=E2=80=99 Article III p=
owers; (iii) violates the Fifth Amendment=E2=80=99s Due Process and Equal P=
rotection clauses; (iv) violates the Fifth and Sixth Amendment=E2=80=99s ri=
ght to counsel; (v) violates Article I of the Constitution. Plaintiff seeks=
