m Gender Ideology Extremism and Restoring Biological Truth to the Federal G=
overnment,=E2=80=9D which directs federal agencies to implement policies on=
 the basis of sex, rather than gender, and prevents policies that accommoda=
te transitioning employees. Plaintiff is a transgender Transportation Secur=
ity Administration (TSA) security officer (TSO). On Nov. 7, 2025, Plaintiff=
 filed a <a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.va=
