ction, concluding that the policy could only be challenged through the admi=
nistrative procedures established by the Civil Service Reform Act (CSRA).</=
p><p>The Plaintiffs appealed the dismissal, and on June 3, the Fourth Circu=
it <a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.ca4.1734=
68/gov.uscourts.ca4.173468.41.0.pdf" aria-label=3D"vacated the dismissal an=
d remanded- opens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer"=
