ance centers authorized by Congress under Title IV to assist with the deseg=
regation of public schools. SEF was provided a five-year grant to operate t=
he EAC in 2022.</p><p>On January 20, President Trump signed Executive Order=
 (EO) 14151, titled =E2=80=9CEnding Radical and Wasteful Government DEI Pro=
