 Federal Government.=E2=80=9D On Jan. 21, Trump issued EO 14173 =E2=80=9CEn=
ding Illegal Discrimination and Restoring Merit-Based Opportunity=E2=80=9D =
which reiterated the illegality of DEI programs.</p><p>Following the releas=
