FLREA) and the Administrative Procedure Act (APA). FLREA dictates a number =
of public-participation requirements, including that the Secretaries hold a=
n annual photography contest to select the winning image that will appear o=
n the Annual Pass for that year. The official rules governing the contest r=
equire that the photo be taken on federal public lands or waters. In Novemb=
