=E2=80=9D In response, the Department of the Interior issued guidance on =
=E2=80=9C<a href=3D"https://www.doi.gov/sites/default/files/documents/2025-=
04/alternative-arrangements-nepa-during-national-energy-emergency-2025-04-2=
