w procedure allowing energy project proponents to opt into a 14-day environ=
mental review process without public notice and comment. Under the new guid=
ance, the Bureau of Land Management (BLM) approved a right-of-way amendment=
 authorizing the Wildcat Loadout Facility in Carbon County, Utah, to increa=
se crude oil transloading capacity from 20,000 to 100,000 barrels per day, =
allegedly a roughly 400% increase.</p><p>On March 26, 2026, Eagle County, C=
