 is attempting to use the committee without meeting the ESA legal requireme=
nts to strip protections from all Gulf of Mexico oil and gas operations. Pl=
aintiff further alleges that Burgum violated the ESA=E2=80=99s mandatory pr=
ocedural requirements by publishing a single vague one-page Federal Registe=
r notice with 15 days=E2=80=99 notice, identifying no applicant, no specifi=
