cuse "all oil and gas activities" in the Gulf of America from the procedura=
l and substantive requirements of the Endangered Species Act (ESA), and is =
based on a National Security Finding (Finding) issued by the Secretary of D=
efense on March 13, 2026, asserting that ongoing or future litigation threa=
