>On Sept. 27, 2025, President Donald J. Trump posted on social media that =
=E2=80=9CI am directing Secretary of War, Pete Hegseth, to provide all nece=
ssary Troops to protect War ravaged Portland, and any of our ICE Facilities=
 under siege from attack by Antifa, and other domestic terrorists. I am als=
o authorizing Full Force, if necessary.=E2=80=9D On Sept. 28, Secretary Pet=
e Hegseth sent a<a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.usco=
