us in violation of the equality of state sovereignty; the Separation of Pow=
ers and the Militia and Take Care Clauses; and the Administrative Procedure=
s Act (APA) as arbitrary and capricious, in excess of statutory authority, =
and contrary to law. Plaintiffs seek a declaration that any order federaliz=
ing and deploying members of the Oregon National Guard is ultra vires and c=
ontrary to law and a preliminary and permanent injunction against their dep=
loyment.</p></span></li><li class=3D" none" data-dtr-index=3D"9" data-dt-ro=
