ance%20Awards%20to%20Institutions._.pdf" aria-label=3D"Rate Cap Policy - op=
ens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">Rate Cap Poli=
cy </a>is contrary to law, in excess of statutory authority, and arbitrary =
and capricious in violation of the Administrative Procedure Act and seek a =
vacatur of the Hegseth and Michael Memos instituting the Rate Cap Policy an=
