du/sites/default/files/Implementation%20of%20a%2015%20Percent%20Indirect%20=
Cost%20Cap%20on%20Assistance%20Awards%20to%20Institutions._.pdf" aria-label=
=3D"Rate Cap Policy - opens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener n=
oreferrer">Rate Cap Policy </a>is contrary to law, in excess of statutory a=
uthority, and arbitrary and capricious in violation of the Administrative P=
rocedure Act and seek a vacatur of the Hegseth and Michael Memos institutin=
g the Rate Cap Policy and declaratory and injunctive relief. </p></span></l=
i><li class=3D" none" data-dtr-index=3D"9" data-dt-row=3D"208" data-dt-colu=
