arget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">preliminary injunctions</a> bl=
ocking the Department of Education from denying and discontinuing certain g=
rants based on alleged anti-DEI and civil rights conflicts, finding the act=
ions likely arbitrary and capricious and contrary to law under the APA and =
ordering reconsideration.</p></td>
