enting federal employees, journalists, and foreign service workers brought =
a suit against Kari Lake, Senior Advisor to the Acting CEO of USAGM, Victor=
 Morales, Acting CEO of USAGM, and USAGM for the dismantling of USAGM. The =
Plaintiffs argue that the government=E2=80=99s conduct violates the First A=
mendment, the Administrative Procedure Act (as =E2=80=9Carbitrary and capri=
cious=E2=80=9D action, not in accordance with law, and unreasonably withhol=
ding agency action), the Statutory Firewall law, and the Appointments Claus=
e. Plaintiffs seek declaratory relief and a preliminary and permanent injun=
ction to return USAGM and its employees, contractors, and grantees to their=
 prior status and to restore all programming and grant funding.</p></span><=
