tion and Customs Enforcement (ICE), claiming that recent policy modificatio=
ns by the USCIS governing treatment of an asylum application by a UAC viola=
ted the APA, the Immigration and Nationality Act, and the Due Process Claus=
e. The Court entered a temporary restraining order which was then converted=
 into a preliminary injunction, and the parties reached a final settlement =
agreement (<a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.=
mdd.457483/gov.uscourts.mdd.457483.199.2.pdf" aria-label=3D"Settlement Agre=
