>On June 27, 2025, the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) announced the =
termination of Haiti=E2=80=99s designation for Temporary Protected Status (=
TPS), under the theory that gang violence perpetrated by armed groups =E2=
=80=9Cpersists=E2=80=9D in Haiti and that the Haitian government is unable =
to restore order. Plaintiffs, a group of Haitian TPS holders, called this d=
ecision =E2=80=9Can inversion of the TPS statute=E2=80=99s basic humanitari=
an purpose=E2=80=9D and filed a <a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.co=
