ov.uscourts.dcd.277039.11.0.pdf" aria-label=3D"amended complaint- opens in =
new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">amended complaint</a=
> and proposed class action seeking to proceed both individually and on beh=
alf of a putative class of all others who =E2=80=9Cwere, are, or will be su=
bject to=E2=80=9D the Proclamation, along with a <a href=3D"https://storage=
.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.dcd.277039/gov.uscourts.dcd.277039.13=
.0.pdf" aria-label=3D"motion- opens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"no=
