/storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.dcd.277039/gov.uscourts.dcd.2=
77039.14.0.pdf" aria-label=3D"motion- opens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" r=
el=3D"noopener noreferrer">motion</a> for a classwide preliminary injunctio=
n, and an <a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.d=
