 opens in new tab" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">emergency =
motion</a> to stay the removal of individual Plaintiffs currently within th=
e United States who could be imminently deported under Proclamation 10888.<=
/p><p><strong><strong>Feb. 20, 2025:</strong></strong> Judge Moss issued an=
 <a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.dcd.277039=
/gov.uscourts.dcd.277039.16.0.pdf" aria-label=3D"administrative stay- opens=
