=99s determination that he was subject to mandatory detention under the Imm=
igration and Nationality Act (INA) rather than discretionary detention. Pet=
itioner is a noncitizen detainee held in immigration custody, who alleges t=
hat his prolonged detention without an individualized bond hearing violates=
 the INA, Fifth Amendment Due Process Clause, Administrative Procedure Act =
