 2025 that Petitioner=E2=80=99s detention is governed by discretionary dete=
ntion authority, not mandatory detention. The court ordered the government =
to provide a bond hearing within seven days or release him, and enjoined hi=
s transfer or removal pending that hearing.</p></td><td class=3D"column-10 =
none dtr-hidden" style=3D"display: none;"><p><strong><strong>Nov. 7, 2025:<=
/strong></strong> Defendants appealed Judge Tunheim=E2=80=99s October 22nd =
judgment granting the habeas petition to the Eighth Circuit.</p><p><strong>=
