lication or dissemination of the surveys regarding their roles in the inves=
tigations would violate the Privacy Act and place them at risk of serious h=
arm. They seek an injunction against =E2=80=9Cthe aggregation, storage, rep=
orting, publication or dissemination=E2=80=9D of information identifying FB=
