April 3, 80% of NEH staff members were put on administrative leave. The NEH=
 has also announced plans to use NEH funds for an arts project, =E2=80=9CNa=
tional Garden of American Heroes=E2=80=9D (Garden Project). Three prominent=
 humanities organizations=E2=80=94the American Council of Learned Societies=
 (ACLS), the American Historical Association (AHA), and the Modern Language=
