1</td><td class=3D"column-9 none dtr-hidden" style=3D"display: none;"><p>In=
 March 2025, the United States Agency for International Development (USAID)=
 terminated en masse the services of foreign service limited (FSL) employee=
s, a special class of employees hired into critical senior technical roles,=
 with neither pretermination notice nor individualized assessments of their=
 performance and experience. On Jan. 21, 2026, twenty-nine of these former =
USAID filed a <a href=3D"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscour=
ts.dcd.288644/gov.uscourts.dcd.288644.1.0.pdf" aria-label=3D"complaint- ope=
