es through statute, confirm appointed officers, and conduct oversight. The =
suit asks the court to declare Musk and DOGE to be acting unlawfully, enjoi=
n Musk and DOGE from exercising government authority unless appointed by pr=
oper process, and set aside their actions taken to date.</p></span></li><li=
