 Describing her removal as =E2=80=9Cunprecedented and illegal,=E2=80=9D Coo=
k alleges that under the Federal Reserve Act she can only be removed for =
=E2=80=9Cjust cause,=E2=80=9D which President Trump has failed to demonstra=
te. She further argues that her termination violates the Due Process Clause=
