ed to government email addresses, and the app has a functionality that allo=
ws messages to auto-delete, which was allegedly enabled during the Yemen di=
scussions. American Oversight, a nonprofit focused on government transparen=
cy that regularly files Freedom of Information Act (FOIA) requests with the=
