American Oversight <a href=3D"https://www.justsecurity.org/wp-content/uploa=
ds/2026/03/Oversight-v.-Customs-and-Border-Protection-Complaint.pdf">sued</=
a> CBP, alleging it violated FOIA by failing to conduct adequate searches f=
