's license numbers and the last four digits of their Social Security number=
s. On March 10, 2026, Plaintiff American Oversight, a nonpartisan nonprofit=
 government transparency organization, filed a <a href=3D"https://www.justs=
ecurity.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AMERICAN_OVERSIGHT_v_US_DEPART_Compl=
aint.pdf">complaint</a> alleging these lawsuits are part of a broader effor=
t to compile a national voter database, with DOJ intending to cross-referen=
ce the collected data with a Department of Homeland Security (DHS) database=
