.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) for use in criminal and immig=
ration-related investigations. American Oversight submitted four FOIA reque=
sts to DOJ and ICE in December 2025 seeking records about the agencies' col=
lection, use, and sharing of voter data. The complaint alleges that Defenda=
nts failed to comply with FOIA's statutory time-limit provisions, failed to=
 issue final determinations, and have produced no responsive records, leavi=
ng Plaintiff unable to inform the public about the voter data program. Plai=
ntiff alleges two violations of the Freedom of Information Act, 5 U.S.C. =
=C2=A7 552: (1) failure to conduct adequate searches for responsive records=
; and (2) wrongful withholding of non-exempt responsive records. Plaintiff =
seeks an order requiring Defendants to conduct reasonable searches, produce=
 all non-exempt records within 20 days accompanied by indexes justifying an=
